/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (Deluge scripting: the scripting language of Zoho Creator, in which the logic of a custom function is written. The Deluge editor provides a list of ready-made statements such as conditions, data-access operations, set variable, call function, send mail and return.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
